- docs/THAM-CHIEU.md muc 8: bo sung 7 bien WEB2API_* thieu (COMBO_THU_LAI_NHANH_GIAY,
  DANG_NHAP_HONG_LIEN_TIEP_DUNG, DO_CHUAN, JWT_LAM_MOI_BAT, JWT_LAM_MOI_KHOANG_GIAY,
  THU_CHAT_GIAN_CACH_GIAY, THU_CHAT_TRAN_GIAY) voi mac dinh doc tu ma; them dong
  GET /api/trinh-duyet/{module}/man-hinh vao bang duong.
- README.md: nhac GET /api/trinh-duyet/{module}/man-hinh (anh JPEG man hinh dang
  dang nhap tu dong, chi quan tri, chi xem) o muc noVNC.
- scripts/kiem_module.py: URL chi la dinh danh (claim JWT
  https://api.openai.com/profile, chi lam khoa dict, khong fetch) khong tinh la
  goi mang ra — chatgpt-web het bao loi mang_ra; them test hoi quy nv85.
- requirements.txt: khai paho-mqtt==2.1.0 (manifest mqtt yeu_cau_goi=[paho] nhung
  requirements thieu) — test_moi_manifest_goi_thieu_rong het do.
- test_web2api_nv187: them 6 ngoai le da kiem chung thu cong (log.* trong with khoa
  chi giu ham_khoa._KHOA_LUONG, khong quay lai dung khoa dang giu).
